WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:00.790
Tap.

2
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.690
Pay.

3
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.110
The game you wanted is on your phone.

4
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.570
Your friend wants it too, so you
try to put your copy on their phone.

5
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:13.370
Then you decide to change one feature,
so you try to open up its code.

6
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.710
You paid for it.

7
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.970
So is it yours to copy, share
and change however you like?

8
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:24.030
In this mission, you'll discover that copyright
protects a creator's work automatically,

9
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.390
usually for the creator's
life plus 70 years.

10
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.710
You'll see that it covers
code, graphics and sound,

11
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.050
and why it protects
the work, not the idea.

12
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.010
And you'll find out what you
actually get when you buy software.

13
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.440
Your mission: work out exactly
what your money bought.
